## m2_symmetry.py  (exact character count; is K_M2 != 0 forced by the stabilizer GL2^3 x <tau> of M2?)
dim W = dim (S^l A (x) S^m B (x) S^m C)^{GL2^3} = 5
tr(tau | W) = 5  => dim W^+ = 5 , dim W^- = 0
g = dim M = 4 ; swap of the two [m] factors on M: dim M^+ = 4 , dim M^- = 0
=> rank of phi -> phi(iso(M2)) <= dim W^+ * [M^- = 0] ... ; lower bound dim K_M2 >= 0

